(7356659, 1150802, 16106, '<td valign="top">The only possible knock on this image is that it doesn''t scream BRIDGE loud enough. I would bet it would have scored higher in landscape. It is a lovely image full of fascinating detail with a complex set of lighting conditions that you managed to make harmonious. My pick for the blue.<br/>And after consideration bumping it up more.</td>', 'The only possible knock on this image is that it doesn''t scream BRIDGE loud enough. I would bet it would have scored higher in landscape. It is a lovely image full of fascinating detail with a complex set of lighting conditions that you managed to make harmonious. My pick for the blue.And after consideration bumping it up more.', '2015-06-02 23:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
