(7356919, 1150791, 163081, '<td valign="top">I used a wide angle adaptor in front of the 18-55mm lens. It was a nearly impossible shot as in fact all was very dark under the bridge but way too bright in the back.  I used an ND filter on one half of the picture. it was a 1 minute exposure in bulb mode.<br/>The green is really like that and it was raining cats and dogs at that moment. That''s why it looks soo blurry. The water was streaming wildly under the bridge.</td>', 'I used a wide angle adaptor in front of the 18-55mm lens. It was a nearly impossible shot as in fact all was very dark under the bridge but way too bright in the back.  I used an ND filter on one half of the picture. it was a 1 minute exposure in bulb mode.The green is really like that and it was raining cats and dogs at that moment. That''s why it looks soo blurry. The water was streaming wildly under the bridge.', '2015-06-03 12:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7356949, 1150529, 12611, '<td valign="top">Impressive. great shot and congrats on the result.</td>', 'Impressive. great shot and congrats on the result.', '2015-06-03 13:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
