(7357026, 1150685, 177322, '<td valign="top">What I like about this image is its purity. By purity, I mean lack of or minimal processing. There are plenty of textures to explore and the colors are real-world muted. The subject bridge dominates over the other structure and is a perfect element in the frame for the eye to rest upon.  Not that it really matters, but I was your second ten.<br/> <br/>Truly a lovely image.</td>', 'What I like about this image is its purity. By purity, I mean lack of or minimal processing. There are plenty of textures to explore and the colors are real-world muted. The subject bridge dominates over the other structure and is a perfect element in the frame for the eye to rest upon.  Not that it really matters, but I was your second ten. Truly a lovely image.', '2015-06-03 16:46:37.000000', NULL, 0),
